            "html": "<section data-stage=\"weiqi\" class=\"sec hero hero-sub\">\n<div class=\"hero-text\">\n<h1 class=\"h1 rise\">Seminář s mistrem Vincentem Chu v Praze</h1>\n<p class=\"lead rise d1\">21. 11. – 22. 11. 2026</p>\n<p class=\"body rise d2\">Guo Yang Tzu – statický čchi-kung, vhodný i pro začátečníky. Mistr Vincent Chu předvede uvolnění síly <em>fa jin</em>.</p>\n<div class=\"actions rise d3\"><a href=\"/kontakt/?tema=5#formular\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Přihlásit se <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#letak\" class=\"more\">Leták a podrobnosti <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</section>"
